{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act35side_level_act35side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act35side",
  "stageId": "act35side_04",
  "title": "家傳金拖鞋",
  "storyCode": "AS-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bddaaea4edb970657abc2a0f360ea421f2f27d891823a7d81bee05572288ace7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g4_ctizengarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出身高貴的學者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，能夠在此遇到您真是我的殊榮，哈特謝普蘇特女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出身高貴的學者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您此次帶來的新曆紀時代初期製成的拖鞋當真是令我大開眼界，想不到數百年前的古人有如此精妙的製鞋工藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出身高貴的學者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們竟然能鍛造出如此貼合足部曲線的鞋履，上面裝飾的蓮花紋飾，更是生動無比。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出身高貴的學者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更不用說，這隻拖鞋誕生自那場大爆炸不久後，體現了當地氣候劇烈變化的一面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出身高貴的學者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只可惜，拖鞋只有一隻，不能湊成一雙，恐怕不能在比賽中奪下第一啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，能拿個二等獎也不錯，重在參與嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出身高貴的學者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也是，哈特謝普蘇特女士您貴為帕夏之女，未來更是要繼承帕夏之位，肯定不在乎這些微末榮譽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個……還早啦，很多事情都說不定呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地位不凡的富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我聽聞哈特謝普蘇特女士的幼弟已經被定為史官職位的繼承者，兩個月後便要出發前往黃金之城了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出身高貴的學者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，像哈特謝普蘇特女士這樣天資非同一般的孩子都沒能中選，可見令弟的天賦之高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……都一樣都一樣，我和他差不多啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地位不凡的富商",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看您說的，難道成為帕夏就不需要天賦與能力了嗎？我看哈特謝普蘇特女士要是成為帕夏，也必定能為家族延續榮光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出身高貴的學者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是不一樣的，畢竟哈特謝普蘇特女士的家族是薩爾貢最為輝煌的史官家族啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g3_menatmainstreet_river"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "馬上就輪到我們登記了，你想好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你那麼自信地走進參賽的報名隊伍，結果身上什麼珍寶都沒有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你覺得我走路的儀態有什麼需要改進的地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼，算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來這種時候，你還是得靠我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是不會看著我的手下吃虧的。給我一點時間，我想想辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在短跑競速賽拿過銀牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想拿起那個金杯子就跑？不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些有錢人帶著的護衛，來頭都不小。看那個人轉身的步法就知道他在王酋的軍隊裡幹了不少年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在無甲格鬥中也拿了銀牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搶劫？被搶的人就在現場，我們怎麼可能拿搶來的東西參賽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，在祭典舞蹈大賽中，我也拿了銀牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你要走這條路？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，不用為難自己……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實際上，我在十個不同的比賽項目裡獲得了十枚銀牌，並且我一直將它們帶在身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——十枚銀牌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些獎牌是米諾斯傳統文化的體現，也是我個人最為珍視的榮譽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "榮譽本不該被當做可比試高低的珍奇，但情況特殊，我只有如此選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外，娜仁圖亞，我希望你不要誤解我。我絕不會以那樣不正當的手段參與競爭，那會使我的家族蒙羞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前我確實誤解你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我的可靠手下，我的大事業……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，你剛剛說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼。我在說你怎麼一塊金牌都沒有，難怪那麼想要那個金杯子，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，我有計劃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g8_sargondeluxeroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……請問……使者引我到這裡，是為了什麼指示？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石屏風後的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？沒有沒有，不是什麼指示，就是想拜託你一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石屏風後的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你看到一隻黃金拖鞋……不要給它太高的分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石屏風後的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，當然也不能太低！還是要保證歷史學家的專業性！比如說，第二名的成績就剛剛好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石屏風後的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拜託啦，這對我真的很重要！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那件展品本就具有珍貴的歷史價值，如果您主觀想要降低評分，這也不算對其他參賽者不公平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石屏風後的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石屏風後的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你如果猜到了我的身分，也請幫我保密，謝謝啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，尊敬的女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前的老師們，考古行動的同僚們……我之後一定向你們好好道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是……只有這一次，我絕對絕對不能輸！憑什麼大家都覺得，我已經輸給那小子了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咿呀————————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（捂嘴）……是我嚇到他了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g3_menatmainstreet_river"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "記住了？複述一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚恐的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "米、米諾斯的銀牌套組……必須高分……一定要第、第三名……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別擔心，和你坐在一間屋子裡的裁判們，大部分我都見過了。他們都和我滿聊得來的，希望你也一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚恐的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊……帕夏大人……貪污者的絞刑架……饒過我吧……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（……不會吧，這就嚇得站不起來了？之前唬住保全和其他裁判的時候沒遇到這麼大的反應啊，他看到什麼幻覺了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（唉，我把你扛回門口吧。難道是我一不小心源石技藝用太猛了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（等等，有腳步聲。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔……這裡也沒看到那位裁判，那應該是被保全護送回會議室了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是去忙自己的吧，太陽可不會等人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……哎呀，看看我遇到了誰？我可真是幸運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g4_ctizengarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，您再說一遍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，我很榮幸地通知您，您的參賽物品進入了最終階段評選。換言之，您進入了大會前三名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是這句，後一句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍後請隨我移步水邊，共同參與頒獎環節與將寶物沉入河中的儀式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以……你們要把我的十枚獎牌扔進河裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會呢，那太粗魯了，我們絕不敢如此冒犯河中的神靈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們會將寶物放在小小的莎草船上，再加上金銀珠寶作為配重。眾人將在神聖的吟詠中，注視著祭祀品緩緩下沉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一條沒有寫在你們的宣傳冊上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，其實我們寫在了選手需要簽名的參賽須知裡。集會本來的目的，便是選出最有歷史價值的寶物，以求叩響神靈之門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每一年的漫灌節，都會有被青睞的幸運兒親眼目睹神靈漫步河畔的身影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，這確實是我的失誤。我報名時已經接近截止時間，來不及完整閱讀數十頁的參賽須知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣吧，女士。鑒於觀光客進入最後評選的情況實屬罕見，現在您有二次確認的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您要繼續參加嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "娜仁圖亞……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……她還沒回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，您是想找專家諮詢嗎？我可以帶您與集會首席裁判溝通……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用了，我需要的不是建議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我確定繼續參加。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g4_ctizengarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂？阿娜特，聽我說！你可以準備晚上的慶功宴啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯，那還用說，我絕對不會辜負你出借展品的恩情！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我保證，晚上回去之後我會當著你的面把寶石放進去，祖拜爾如果有變化，你也可以親眼看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你放心，祖拜爾被我保護得很好，絕不會有任何污漬和損壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……讓、讓他說句話？不行不行，他……被我保護起來了嘛，我怎麼可能在眾目睽睽之下把通訊器拿給他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，我們還是說點別的吧！你根本不知道我有多難！我為了保證拿到第二名，跟那些老學究裁判周旋了一上午。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你聽，會場裡馬上就要宣布評選結果了。等拿到那顆寶石，我要立刻回到清靜的博物館——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，沒關係……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……奇怪，這裡人行道也不窄啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g8_sargondeluxeroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，總算可以放心了。佩佩搞定寶石的事了，祖拜爾先生也沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等會我們一起去喝杯飲料？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你怎麼欲言又止的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不會想聽的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "緹緹，我想聽你的建議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能你會覺得很荒唐……但我覺得特展可以重新開始，把事故包裝一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就當是某種節目效果，換了一種更為生動……也更加活靈活現的展出方式？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "展出會活動的古屍和文物，順便提高票價？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差不多吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你應該知道本地人一般用什麼來嚇唬愛哭的小孩吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博物館裡的展品奇怪一點不會有問題的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我待過的哥倫比亞的博物館就有“如果成功了會比失敗更恐怖的科技創意展覽”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是緹緹，那種以賺錢為第一目標的商業化營運想法，在這裡會惹很多人生氣，很多很多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這座城市的立身之本可是歷史！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這座城市的立身之本難道不是那條快要枯竭的寶石礦脈嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……等一下我們去見那些貴族的時候千萬別這麼說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個家族幾乎和博物館大廳那塊陵墓的石磚一樣古老，而且保守。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼我們有那麼多王酋、帕夏們總是愛管這管那！他們就不能像佩佩的家族一樣每年按時打筆鉅款，然後對這裡的一切不聞不問嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "緹緹，代理館長的機會來之不易，我真的不想惹上什麼麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麻煩……你居然把這當麻煩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不是這個意思……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那就按你說的來吧，我先走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "緹緹，我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g4_ctizengarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴謹的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（您還好嗎？我看您滿頭大汗……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（是、是嗎？……今天室外太熱了，哈哈，您也在流汗啊……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來是輝煌的史官家族傳人、王者與英雄的傳頌者、足跡遍布薩爾貢的探險家、博聞之人、尊貴的帕夏之女——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈特謝普蘇特女士為我們帶來的珍奇寶物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（那……這個結果，您來宣布？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴謹的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不，這麼重要的機會，還是請您來吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（……哈哈，那我不敢再推辭了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，這隻黃金拖鞋上有金絲編織的蓮花，並根據當時急劇變化的薩爾貢氣候進行了特殊設計，有著非常清晰的時代特徵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，它來自聲名顯赫的帝國史官家族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們很難在市面上看到保存如此完整的，且與史官家族風格不符的日用品——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在以往的集會中，從史官家族流出的大多是書信、文稿等藏品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而今天，這隻拖鞋，它向我們展示了貴族在那個時代生活的另一個側面，它的價值不可估量！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，謝謝您的點評。接下來我將公布裁判席評分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "去掉一個最高分，去掉一個最低分，哈特謝普蘇特女士的最終得分是\n——94.95分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀……抱歉，尊敬的哈特謝普蘇特女士，您以0.05分之差，暫時位居第二……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我們基於公正的原則和對歷史的尊重得出的結果，請您諒解，哈特謝普蘇特女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事沒事，和我的預期一樣，嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1494_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "米納特哈瑪儀很榮幸能接受您的考驗……我、我們還是進入下一件吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，下一件，也是本次大會的最後一件參賽展品……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……來自異域的珍寶，米諾斯的銀牌套組。有請我們的專家做出評價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴謹的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們都知道……薩爾貢邊遠的地區同樣有著璀璨的文明，米諾斯地區的一些文化藝術也能很好地與薩爾貢的風俗融合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴謹的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這套銀牌不僅體現了米諾斯人熱愛體育運動的傳統，更重要的是，和大多數參賽展品相比，它的製成年份能被尤為精確地判定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴謹的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且……眾所周知，我們的生活中充滿了金製品，但銀製品卻是很少見的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴謹的集會裁判",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事實上，在一些歷史階段中，銀確實比金更加珍貴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常有趣的點評！那麼，最終究竟會是哪三位選手獲得代表城市祭祀河流的機會呢？請允許我為大家揭曉這一寶物獲得的評分……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "去掉一個最高分，去掉一個最低分，來自米諾斯的阿斯帕齊婭女士最終得分是\n——94.60分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這真是前所未有的激烈競爭！阿斯帕齊婭女士，您最終位列第三，雖然有些遺憾，但您也獲得了祭祀的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常感謝，這正是我需要的認可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，如果你們允許的話，大會結束後我要向你們抗議獎項設置的問題。我認為米諾斯的金杯不該只是三等獎獎品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，女士，但請您先到台上來，拿上您的展品，跟隨工作人員的指引。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第三名，阿斯帕齊婭女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第二名，哈特謝普蘇特女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一名，拉沙德女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三位獲獎選手，請小心不要損壞手中的展品……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉沙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉沙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真不好意思，天氣太熱，我有些虛脫……一時沒拿穩手裡的東西，讓各位見笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉沙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，可惜我拿來的這件古陶罐摔碎了。我想，用碎片祭祀河流恐怕是不行的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這……從未有過先例……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉沙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真讓人傷心啊……我恐怕只能放棄這個第一了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉沙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，尊敬的帕夏之女，哈特謝普蘇特女士，這會場裡本就不該有比您名次更高的人，這第一給您才是實至名歸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉沙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就這樣吧，我自願放棄我的名次，退出比賽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……場上出現了意外情況！但我相信，在場所有人都認同，我們尊敬的帕夏之女應該獲得大會頭名！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，獲得二至四名的選手將順次獲得我們的一二三等獎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "集會主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我們祝賀他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
